{"4663760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anomaly Control Simulator", "steam_appid": 4663760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Anomaly Control Simulator,  you become an employee of a secret bureau for anomaly control. Every day, dozens of them pass through your department disguised as ordinary objects while breaking the laws of physics, logic, and reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/9a07312863b2eb4e003a0f8d9a6b894b.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/9a07312863b2eb4e003a0f8d9a6b894b.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/9a07312863b2eb4e003a0f8d9a6b894b.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>It's dangerous to go alone! Take this </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine artifacts with specialized equipment. Uncover dangerous properties, run tests, and decide the fate of each anomaly. And don't worry if you fail. You'll be very easy to replace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/0da17b3f5580b15b762a6d26c7d92b45.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/0da17b3f5580b15b762a6d26c7d92b45.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/0da17b3f5580b15b762a6d26c7d92b45.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The ends justify the means</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The job must get done, even at the cost of a life. If not yours, then someone else's. Run experiments with people to uncover the dangerous properties of anomalies and make the right call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/1da99fa041b612a8bc9234eb05c5417f.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/1da99fa041b612a8bc9234eb05c5417f.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/1da99fa041b612a8bc9234eb05c5417f.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Keep an eye on the world's chaos level</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think hard about what to do with each anomaly. The fate of the world depends on whose hands it falls into!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/8683c23a7000f78b487abd17c24a5cdc.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/8683c23a7000f78b487abd17c24a5cdc.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/8683c23a7000f78b487abd17c24a5cdc.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A man's home is his castle</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your workspace to improve efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/8d4fab76c429a3ce2e87072fd17d5014.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/8d4fab76c429a3ce2e87072fd17d5014.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/8d4fab76c429a3ce2e87072fd17d5014.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sometimes they break loose</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A containment breach is no reason to stop working. Contain them at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/3d73b00bd0d76d22412eee333b3977e8.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/3d73b00bd0d76d22412eee333b3977e8.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/3d73b00bd0d76d22412eee333b3977e8.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Not every threat looks like a monster</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of artifacts hide monstrous danger inside and only you stand between them and the world. Don't let us down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/26b82ee5857bb0720a5ae533c77e1e2d.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/26b82ee5857bb0720a5ae533c77e1e2d.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/26b82ee5857bb0720a5ae533c77e1e2d.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Anomaly Control Simulator,  you become an employee of a secret bureau for anomaly control. Every day, dozens of them pass through your department disguised as ordinary objects while breaking the laws of physics, logic, and reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/9a07312863b2eb4e003a0f8d9a6b894b.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/9a07312863b2eb4e003a0f8d9a6b894b.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/9a07312863b2eb4e003a0f8d9a6b894b.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>It's dangerous to go alone! Take this </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine artifacts with specialized equipment. Uncover dangerous properties, run tests, and decide the fate of each anomaly. And don't worry if you fail. You'll be very easy to replace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/0da17b3f5580b15b762a6d26c7d92b45.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/0da17b3f5580b15b762a6d26c7d92b45.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/0da17b3f5580b15b762a6d26c7d92b45.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The ends justify the means</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The job must get done, even at the cost of a life. If not yours, then someone else's. Run experiments with people to uncover the dangerous properties of anomalies and make the right call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/1da99fa041b612a8bc9234eb05c5417f.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/1da99fa041b612a8bc9234eb05c5417f.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/1da99fa041b612a8bc9234eb05c5417f.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Keep an eye on the world's chaos level</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think hard about what to do with each anomaly. The fate of the world depends on whose hands it falls into!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=